The '''HCT-2001 ''Dragon''-class Reugeot 905 freighter''',<ref name="BMF 93" /> also known as the '''Trandoshan prisoner ship''',<ref name="TVE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> also known as the '''Trandoshan transport''',<ref name="Episode Gallery">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/padawan-lost-episode-guide|text="Padawan Lost" Episode Guide &#124; The Clone Wars}} {{C|Slide 3}}</ref> or '''Trandoshan slave ship''',<ref name="Concept Art Gallery">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/padawan-lost-concept-art-gallery|text="Padawan Lost" Concept Art Gallery}} {{C|Slide 4}}</ref> was a model of freighter which was well-suited to transporting captive beings. [[Garnac's hunting guild]] used [[Vermin-Thrax|one]] of these ships to ferry [[prisoner]]s intended to be [[Hunting|hunted]] as prey on the [[moon]] [[Wasskah]].<ref name="Padawan Lost" /> The HCT-2001 was also later used by [[pirate]] gangs, including that of the [[Syvik Delegation]].<ref name="Gangsters of Galzez">{{RebelsMagCite|20|The Gangsters of Galzez}}</ref>

